blocks.en:
Mancala #928 Task. Execute moves under the sowing, capture, extra-turn, and
terminal-sweep rules. Termination takes precedence over extra turns;
event flags describe the last executed move. Question. Execute B5 followed by B6. Return the complete board state
and event flags after move 2. Answer. Top=7,3,0,1,8,0; Bottom=3,0,0,7,0,0; Store1=2; Store2=0;
Next=P1; Step=2; ExtraTurn=1; Capture=0; Captured=0; GameOver=0

Results across demonstration assignments. Tables 13 and 14 report all three assignments and their observed variation. The same 400
real-world targets and zero-shot baseline are used for each model;
only the assigned game demonstrations vary between the three evaluations.

